isperse. Then 4 p.m. ticked by on the clock. Still no movement.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/02/sports/02onsoccer-protest/merlin_187209180_8aa9b0ea-d639-4105-835b-d5955d3e8e2d-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 389, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/02/sports/02onsoccer-protest/merlin_187209180_8aa9b0ea-d639-4105-835b-d5955d3e8e2d-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 389}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/02/sports/02onsoccer-protest/merlin_187209180_8aa9b0ea-d639-4105-835b-d5955d3e8e2d-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 664, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/02/sports/02onsoccer-protest/merlin_187209180_8aa9b0ea-d639-4105-835b-d5955d3e8e2d-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1327, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/02/sports/02onsoccer-protest/02onsoccer-protest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/02/sports/02onsoccer-protest/02onsoccer-protest-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/02/sports/02onsoccer-protest/02onsoccer-protest-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'In Anti-Ownership Protests, United Fans Rediscover Their Own Power', 'kicke