eaming service this month in the United States. These are the ones worth catching first.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the heels of one of the most unusual and controversial Oscar ceremonies to date, Netflix in the United States is bidding farewell — at least for now — to several previous nominees and winners of note. And it’s your last chance to binge a pair of riveting crime series, as well as a couple of first-rate indies that are well worth your time. (Dates reflect the final day a title is available.)', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/arts/23WARHORSE/23WARHORSE-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'height': 409, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2011/12/23/arts/23WARHORSE/23WARHORSE-articleLarge-v3.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 409}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/arts/23WARHORSE/23WARHORSE-jumbo-v3.jpg', 'height': 698, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/arts/23WARHORSE/23WARHORSE-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1283, 'width': 1881, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/arts/23WARHORSE/23WARHORSE-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2011/12/23/arts/23WARHORSE/23WARHORSE-thumbStandard-v3.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2011/12/23/arts/23WARHORSE/23WARHORSE-thumbLarge-v2.jpg