e Feeling Last?', 'kicker': 'On Politics', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Polls and Public Opinion', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Politics and Government', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-03T22:54:56+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Politics', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Giovanni Russonello', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Giovanni', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Russonello', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/1a95f035-e297-58c4-ac05-b0f0aa18cbf9', 'word_count': 1308, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1a95f035-e297-58c4-ac05-b0f0aa18cbf9'}, {'abstract': 'There’s a good case for doing more to improve physical assets. There’s an overwhelming case for doing more to help families with children.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/03/opinion/biden-family-aid.html', 'snippet': 'There’s a good case for doing more to improve physical assets. There’s an overwhelming case for doing more to help families with children.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Like many progressives, I like the Biden administration’s plan to invest in infrastructure, but really love its plans to invest more in people. There’s a good case for doing more to improve physical assets like roads, water supplies and broadband networks. There’s an overwhelming case for doing more to help families with children.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/03/opinion/03krugman-lead/03krugman-lead-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 833, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xl