': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'United States Economy', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Budgets and Budgeting', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Organization for Economic Cooperation and Development', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Biden, Joseph R Jr', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Europe', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'American Rescue Plan (2021)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'American Families Plan (2021)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Republican Party', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Democratic Party', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-03T23:02:18+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Bret Stephens', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Bret', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Stephens', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/2f9dc3fd-c30c-5d5f-be72-8977ecd1a2b5', 'word_count': 862, 'uri': 'nyt://article/2f9dc3fd-c30c-5d5f-be72-8977ecd1a2b5'}, {'abstract': 'The Biden administration’s plans would allow millions of American women to decide whether to work outside the home.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/03/opinion/biden-new-deal.html', 'snippet': 'The Biden administration’s plans would allow millions of American women to decide whether to work outside the home.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The New Deal was mostly for men. The great public works projects that endure in public memory employed men. Labor protections enacted between 1934 and 1939 excluded domestic workers, restaurant workers, retail clerks and others in jobs with large female work forces. New safety nets for the unemployed, for the disabled and for older Americans were similarly tailored for men, who were supposed to provide for everyone else.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/03/opinion/03appelbaum-image/03appelbaum-image-articleLarge.png', 'height': 385, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/03/opinion/03appelbaum-image/03appelbaum-image-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 385}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/03/opinion/03appelbaum-image/03appelbaum-image-jumbo.png', 'height': 658, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/03/opinion/03appelbaum-image/03appelbaum-image-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1316, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/03/opinion/03appelbaum-image/03appelbaum-image-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/03/opinion/03appelbaum-image/03appelbaum-image-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/03/opinion/03appelbaum-image/03appelbaum-image-thumbLarge.png', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'A New Deal, This Time for Everyone', 'kicker': 'Binyamin Appelbaum', 'co