e split of Bill and Melinda Gates raises questions about the fate of their vast fortune.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Bill and Melinda Gates are divorcing after 27 years of marriage, raising questions about the fate of their vast fortune. Their split could yield the biggest divorce settlement on record, according to Forbes’s calculations, surpassing the $35 billion breakup of Amazon’s Jeff Bezos and MacKenzie Scott. Given the likely sums involved, what happens with the Gateses’ extensive investments and charity work will be monitored at the highest levels of government, business and the nonprofit sector.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/04/business/04db-newsletter-gates/merlin_187259571_a22b6f89-676f-4491-8d2d-042c76763795-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/04/business/04db-newsletter-gates/merlin_187259571_a22b6f89-676f-4491-8d2d-042c76763795-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/04/business/04db-newsletter-gates/merlin_187259571_a22b6f89-676f-4491-8d2d-042c76763795-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/04/business/04db-newsletter-gates/merlin_187259571_a22b6f89-676f-4491-8d2d-042c76763795-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/04/business/04db-newsletter-gates/merlin_187259571_a22b6f89-676f-4491-8d2d-042c76763795-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbna