 a Black church, were fueled by racial animosity, federal prosecutors said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A former leader of an extremist group was sentenced to three and a half years in prison on Tuesday for his role in a “swatting” scheme whose targets included journalists, a sitting cabinet secretary and a predominantly Black church, federal prosecutors said.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/04/multimedia/04xp-atomwaffen/merlin_186277920_6fbb19fe-1afa-4935-9efc-4b76a4be0c28-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 534, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/04/multimedia/04xp-atomwaffen/merlin_186277920_6fbb19fe-1afa-4935-9efc-4b76a4be0c28-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 534}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/04/multimedia/04xp-atomwaffen/merlin_186277920_6fbb19fe-1afa-4935-9efc-4b76a4be0c28-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 912, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/04/multimedia/04xp-atomwaffen/merlin_186277920_6fbb19fe-1afa-4935-9efc-4b76a4be0c28-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1781, 'width': 2000, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/04/multimedia/04xp-atomwaffen/04xp-atomwaffen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/04/multimedia/04xp-atomwaffen/04xp-atomwaffen-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/04/multi