year. Profits jumped, beating Wall Street expectations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/05/business/media/nyt-new-york-times-earnings-q1-2021.html', 'snippet': 'The publisher added 301,000 digital subscribers for the first quarter, the slowest gain in over a year. Profits jumped, beating Wall Street expectations.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No doubt, President Biden has lowered the temperature of the nation after four years under Donald J. Trump, a tumultuous period capped by the worst pandemic in a century. He may have also lowered interest in the news. For the first quarter, The New York Times Company recorded its smallest gain in new subscribers in a year and a half.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/05/business/05nyt/merlin_177035100_a7c60adb-a386-4d3a-83b4-5fcd0a52bd09-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/05/business/05nyt/merlin_177035100_a7c60adb-a386-4d3a-83b4-5fcd0a52bd09-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/05/business/05nyt/merlin_177035100_a7c60adb-a386-4d3a-83b4-5fcd0a52bd09-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/05/business/05nyt/merlin_177035100_a7c60adb-a386-4d3a-83b4-5fcd0a52bd09-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/05/business/05nyt/05nyt-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 