get a shot at a game will get a free ticket.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/05/sports/baseball/new-york-baseball-covid-vaccine.html', 'snippet': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo said that fully vaccinated people will be able to sit in areas of Yankee Stadium or Citi Field without social distancing, and that people who get a shot at a game will get a free ticket.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo of New York announced on Wednesday that baseball fans who have been fully vaccinated against the coronavirus will soon be able to enjoy seating arrangements without social distancing at Yankee Stadium and Citi Field, and that spectators who get vaccinated at either stadium during a game will get a free ticket.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/05/us/05-virus-briefing-ny-baseball/05-virus-briefing-ny-baseball-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/05/us/05-virus-briefing-ny-baseball/05-virus-briefing-ny-baseball-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/05/us/05-virus-briefing-ny-baseball/05-virus-briefing-ny-baseball-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/05/us/05-virus-briefing-ny-baseball/05-virus-briefing-ny-baseball-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/05/us/05-virus-briefing-ny-baseball/05-virus-briefing-ny-baseball-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType':