gy exposition.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/06/movies/queen-marie-review.html', 'snippet': 'Alexis Sweet Cahill’s biopic about the Romanian queen is weighed down by stodgy exposition.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Romania has delivered some of the most bracing filmmaking of the past 20 years (“The Death of Mr. Lazarescu,” “4 Months, 3 Weeks and 2 Days”), but “Queen Marie” shows that its cinematic output also extends to stiff, exposition-clotted biopics.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '14', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/06/arts/06queenmarie-art/merlin_187133340_74b6fdec-1b0b-4f61-9d66-052ad01b5044-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/06/arts/06queenmarie-art/merlin_187133340_74b6fdec-1b0b-4f61-9d66-052ad01b5044-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/06/arts/06queenmarie-art/merlin_187133340_74b6fdec-1b0b-4f61-9d66-052ad01b5044-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/06/arts/06queenmarie-art/merlin_187133340_74b6fdec-1b0b-4f61-9d66-052ad01b5044-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1080, 'width': 1920, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/06/arts/06queenmarie-art/merlin_187133340_74b6fdec-1b0b-4f61-9d66-052ad01b5044-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/06/arts/06queenmarie-art/merlin_187133340_74b6fdec-1b0b-4f61-9d66-