ppens when a teenage farmworker, Cody (Jack DiFalco), is sent into a multistory silo to break up clumps of corn. Someone negligently activates the machinery, and Cody becomes marooned in a quicksand-like rush of corn. Any movement might cause him to sink below the surface. And any effort to extract him must account for the forces exerted by 1.5 million pounds of corn.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/07/arts/07SILO-REVIEW-PIX/merlin_187133409_d93da131-4b43-4819-bc7f-b03083f3ebe6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 251, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/07/arts/07SILO-REVIEW-PIX/merlin_187133409_d93da131-4b43-4819-bc7f-b03083f3ebe6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 251}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/07/arts/07SILO-REVIEW-PIX/merlin_187133409_d93da131-4b43-4819-bc7f-b03083f3ebe6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 428, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/07/arts/07SILO-REVIEW-PIX/merlin_187133409_d93da131-4b43-4819-bc7f-b03083f3ebe6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 857, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/07/arts/07SILO-REVIEW-PIX/merlin_187133409_d93da131-4b43-4819-bc7f-b03083f3ebe6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/07/arts/07SILO-REVIEW-PIX/merlin_187133409_d93da131-4b43-4819-bc7f-b03083f3ebe6-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0