0, 'uri': 'nyt://article/63e5f8fe-a2c4-55c1-98cd-7b227675171a'}, {'abstract': "Haven't kids lost enough this year?", 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/06/opinion/nyc-snow-days.html', 'snippet': "Haven't kids lost enough this year?", 'lead_paragraph': 'There were weeks in 2020 when one of my children, just a few years into elementary school, would fall asleep crying almost every night, listing all the things they’d lost and the months, which then turned into a year, they’d never get back. (I’m not being specific about which child; if this ever embarrasses them they can each say it was the other.)', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '22', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/06/opinion/06goldberg-lead/06goldberg-lead-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/06/opinion/06goldberg-lead/06goldberg-lead-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/06/opinion/06goldberg-lead/06goldberg-lead-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/06/opinion/06goldberg-lead/06goldberg-lead-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/06/opinion/06goldberg-lead/06goldberg-lead-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/06/opinion/06goldberg-lead/06goldberg-lead-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 't