e', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/1f91efb4-49bb-59f2-8f61-0779203ca486', 'word_count': 40, 'uri': 'nyt://article/1f91efb4-49bb-59f2-8f61-0779203ca486'}, {'abstract': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Friday, May 7, 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/06/pageoneplus/corrections-may-7-2021.html', 'snippet': 'Corrections that appeared in print on Friday, May 7, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': 'An article on Wednesday about families separated at the U.S. border misstated who paid for the counseling sessions of a migrant child. The counseling sessions were paid for by Seneca Family of Agencies, and not through the settlement of a government lawsuit related to  migrant families separated at the border.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '20', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: May 7, 2021', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-05-07T02:45:28+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/b9524ce3-9feb-5682-b92b-d40ef75bc2c4', 'word_count': 276, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b9524ce3-9feb-5682-b92b-d40ef75bc2c4'}, {'abstract': 'Corrine Brown, a Florida Democrat who served more than two years in prison after being found guilty of running a sham charity, was granted a new trial by a federal appeals court.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/06/us/corrine-brown-conviction-overturned-florida.html', 'snippet': 'Corrine Brown, a Florida Democrat who served more than two years in prison after being found guilty of running a sham charity, was granted a new trial by a federal appeals court.', 'lead_pa