, {'abstract': 'His reviews for Crawdaddy, Rolling Stone and Creem were admired. But his tough criticism at The Austin American-Statesman inspired a “Dump Ed Ward” movement.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/09/business/media/ed-ward-dead.html', 'snippet': 'His reviews for Crawdaddy, Rolling Stone and Creem were admired. But his tough criticism at The Austin American-Statesman inspired a “Dump Ed Ward” movement.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Ed Ward, an uncompromising rock ‘n’ roll critic for Rolling Stone, The Austin American-Statesman and other publications who was also the rock historian on NPR’s “Fresh Air” and the author of two acclaimed books about rock, was found dead on May 3 at his home in Austin, Texas. He was 72.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/obituaries/13Ward1-print/merlin_187431222_4d5c3306-5540-4a60-b38b-5c1f698d093b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 408, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/14/obituaries/13Ward1-print/merlin_187431222_4d5c3306-5540-4a60-b38b-5c1f698d093b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 408}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/obituaries/13Ward1-print/merlin_187431222_4d5c3306-5540-4a60-b38b-5c1f698d093b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 697, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/obituaries/13Ward1-print/merlin_187431222_4d5c3306-5540-4a60-b38b-5c1f698d093b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1393, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/