edlam offers an audacious, if half-baked, take on the Schiller play about the fate of Mary, Queen of Scots.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/09/theater/mary-stuart-review-bedlam.html', 'snippet': 'With four actors and a contemporary setting, Bedlam offers an audacious, if half-baked, take on the Schiller play about the fate of Mary, Queen of Scots.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two queens, a gaggle of self-serving politicians, a murder plot, a rivalry for regal dominance: George R.R. Martin has nothing on the annals of English history. That’s why the stories appeal to so many, from the writer and historian Philippa Gregory to the 18th-century German poet-playwright Friedrich Schiller, whose verse play “Mary Stuart,” about the imprisonment and final days of the famous Queen of Scots, has proved a steady stage draw, especially for zealous actresses.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/arts/07marystuart-1/merlin_187429710_3cc20f1c-56dc-4e41-95d8-053da7b327a8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 337, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/10/arts/07marystuart-1/merlin_187429710_3cc20f1c-56dc-4e41-95d8-053da7b327a8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 337}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/arts/07marystuart-1/merlin_187429710_3cc20f1c-56dc-4e41-95d8-053da7b327a8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 574, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/arts/07marystuart-1/merlin_187429710_3cc20f1c-56dc-4e41-95d8-053da7b327a8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 846, 'width': 1508, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank'