llions strong, these insects have been living in the dark since George W. Bush’s first term as president. Now they are ready for the light. They are climbing out of the darkness, out of their own skins and into the trees. They are here to sing a love song. Their only purpose among the green leaves is love.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/opinion/10renkl-lead/merlin_69623959_b9defded-26f6-461f-b389-0b6cc0ebb2df-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/10/opinion/10renkl-lead/merlin_69623959_b9defded-26f6-461f-b389-0b6cc0ebb2df-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 900}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/opinion/10renkl-lead/merlin_69623959_b9defded-26f6-461f-b389-0b6cc0ebb2df-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 683, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/opinion/10renkl-lead/merlin_69623959_b9defded-26f6-461f-b389-0b6cc0ebb2df-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1366, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/opinion/10renkl-lead/10renkl-lead-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/10/opinion/10renkl-lead/10renkl-lead-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/opinion/10renkl-lead/10renkl-lead-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The Cicadas Are Coming. It’s Not an Invasion. It’s a Miracle.', 'kicker': 'Guest Essay', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'The Cicadas Are Coming: It’s Not an Invasion, It’s a Miracle', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Cicadas (Insects)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'United States', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-10T09:00:17+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Margaret Renkl', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Margaret', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Renkl', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/3b2c7efc-9c24-544c-9873-c28fc78e3fc7', 'word_count': 997, 'uri': 'nyt://article/3b2c7efc-9c24-544c-9873-c28fc78e3fc7'}, {'abstract': 'In a pair of video tutorials, the beauty expert Raisa Flowers shares easy approaches for dressing up the face.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/10/t-magazine/makeup-tutorial-minimal-men.html', 'snippet': 'In a pair of video tutorials, the beauty expert Raisa Flowers shares easy approaches for dressing up the face.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When it comes to her work, the makeup artist Raisa Flowers rarely gets nervous. Over the years, she has painted the faces of celebrities including Rihanna, Zendaya and Kelela and lent her punk aesthetic — defined by bold washes of color and painterly brush strokes — to some of fashion’s biggest brands and publications. But applying smoky eyeliner to a male model’s virgin waterline? The request, which is still relatively rare, she says, fills her with dread, not because of the extreme precision required but because “it can get real male-dominant on set,” she says. “Some of the models will say, ‘Oh, my mom can’t see me in this!’ or ‘What if I run into my bro like this?’”', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/t-magazine/10tmag-beauty-promo/10tmag-beauty-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 338, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/10/t-magazine/10tmag-beauty-promo/10tmag-beauty-promo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 338}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/t-magazine/10tmag-beauty-promo/10tmag-beauty-promo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 576, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/t-magazine/10tmag-beauty-promo/10tmag-beauty-promo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1152, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/t-magazine/10tmag-beauty-promo/10tmag-beauty-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/10/t-magazine/10tmag-beauty-promo/10tmag-beauty-promo-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/t-magazine/10tmag-beauty-promo/10tmag-beauty-promo-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'How to Create Two Minimal Makeup Looks for Men — or Anyone', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'How to; Makeup for Men', 'name': None, 'se