-side-hack.html', 'snippet': 'A deputy national security adviser said that the government believed DarkSide was “a criminal actor” but was looking for any ties to nation-states.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The F.B.I. confirmed on Monday that the hacking group DarkSide was responsible for the ransomware attack that closed a U.S. pipeline providing the East Coast with nearly half of its gasoline and jet fuel.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/lens/10new-wash-brief-pipeline-hack1/merlin_187559967_03e8217b-afd2-4b33-a09f-b8344c47b01f-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/10/lens/10new-wash-brief-pipeline-hack1/merlin_187559967_03e8217b-afd2-4b33-a09f-b8344c47b01f-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/lens/10new-wash-brief-pipeline-hack1/merlin_187559967_03e8217b-afd2-4b33-a09f-b8344c47b01f-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/lens/10new-wash-brief-pipeline-hack1/merlin_187559967_03e8217b-afd2-4b33-a09f-b8344c47b01f-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/lens/10new-wash-brief-pipeline-hack1/10new-wash-brief-pipeline-hack1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/10/lens/10new-wash-brief-pipeline-hack1/10new-wash-brief-pipeline-hack1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/lens/10new-wash-brief-pipeline-hack1/10new-wash-brief-pipeline-hack1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'The F.B.I. confirms that DarkSide, a ransomware group, was behind the hack of a major U.S. pipeline.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Oil (Petroleum) and Gasoline', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'DarkSide (Hacking Group)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Colonial Pipeline Co', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Federal Bureau of Investigation', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-10T16:37:07+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By David E. Sanger and Pranshu Verma', 'person': [{'firstname': 'David', 'middlename': 'E.', 'lastname': 'Sanger', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Pranshu', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Verma', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/53685d02-63cf-5eb7-92b1-ed974a786918', 'word_count': 398, 'uri': 'nyt://article/53685d02-63cf-5eb7-92b1-ed974a786918'}, {'abstract': 'Created by a former bartender at Union Square Cafe, Method Spirits Sweet Vermouth shines in a manhattan or on the rocks.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/10/dining/method-spirits-sweet-vermouth.html', 'snippet': 'Created by a former bartender at Union Square Cafe, Method Spirits Sweet Vermouth shines in a manhattan or on the rocks.', 'lead_paragraph': 'There’s a newcomer in the local vermouth category: Method Spirits Sweet Vermouth. Decidedly in the Italian style, but concocted from herbs and botanicals — both local and imported — and distilled from spirits produced in the Finger Lakes region of New York, the vermouth is the work of Cory Fitzsimmons, a former head bartender at Union Square Cafe, and Jessica McGlinchey, a former assistant head bartender at Union Square Cafe. Your manhattan will blossom with a whiff of bark, dried fennel, toasted hazelnuts and honey. The vermouth is fine with a twist of lemon on the rocks, either before or after dinner. The partners are now working on a French-style dry vermouth. In gratitude for the support they have received from colleagues, they are donating a portion of their profits to the Restaurant Workers’ Community Foundation and its Covid-19 Relief Fund.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/12/dining/10burner-drink1/10burner-drink1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/12/dining/10burner-drink1/10burner-drink1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/12/dining/10burner-drink1/10burner-drink1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/12/dining/10burner-drink1/10burner-drink1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/12/dining/10burner-dr