s rockets at Israeli cities. Israel hits Gaza with airstrikes. Civilians suffer the most casualties, but leaders on each side may reap political benefits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ASHKELON, Israel — The worst fighting between Israelis and Palestinians in seven years intensified on Tuesday night, as Israeli airstrikes began targeting Hamas offices in Gaza City and militants in Gaza fired rockets at the metropolis of Tel Aviv, the southern city of Ashkelon and Israel’s main airport.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'More Than 30 Dead in Gaza and Israel as Fighting Quickly Escalates', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Israel and Hamas Escalate Attacks; Worst in 7 Years ', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Israel', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Palestinians', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Gaza Strip', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Ashkelon (Israel)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Defense and Military Forces', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Hamas', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Civilian Casualties', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Deaths (Fatalities)', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Al Aqsa Mosque (Jerusalem)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Politics and Government', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Netanyahu, Benjamin', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'War and Armed Conflicts', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-11T10:52:57+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name