f them retired, funneled work to a tow truck company for kickbacks and sold car crash victims’ personal information, prosecutors say.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/11/nyregion/nypd-officers-arrested-bribes.html', 'snippet': 'The officers, one of them retired, funneled work to a tow truck company for kickbacks and sold car crash victims’ personal information, prosecutors say.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two New York Police Department officers and a retired officer were charged Tuesday in federal court with running a yearslong bribery scheme that included kickbacks from a tow truck company and the selling of personal information of recent car crash victims to injury lawyers and physical therapists.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '19', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/11/nyregion/11NYPD-BRIBE-1/merlin_184232793_6d0fe97e-c590-4d6a-a42b-3d751d09ef5e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/11/nyregion/11NYPD-BRIBE-1/merlin_184232793_6d0fe97e-c590-4d6a-a42b-3d751d09ef5e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/11/nyregion/11NYPD-BRIBE-1/merlin_184232793_6d0fe97e-c590-4d6a-a42b-3d751d09ef5e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/11/nyregion/11NYPD-BRIBE-1/merlin_184232793_6d0fe97e-c590-4d6a-a42b-3d751d09ef5e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/11/nyregion/11NYPD-BRIBE-1/11