/domestic-terror-white-supremacists.html', 'snippet': '“The department is taking a new approach to addressing domestic violent extremism, both internally and externally,” Homeland Security Secretary Alejandro N. Mayorkas told senators.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Attorney General Merrick B. Garland and Homeland Security Secretary Alejandro N. Mayorkas told senators on Wednesday that the greatest domestic threat facing the United States came from what they both called “racially or ethnically motivated violent extremists.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Top law enforcement officials say the biggest domestic terror threat comes from white supremacists.', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Right-Wing Extremism and Alt-Right', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Fringe Groups and Movements', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'Senate Committee on Appropriations', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Garland, Merrick B', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Mayorkas, Alejandro', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Storming of the US Capitol (Jan, 2021)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-12T16:27:09+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Washington', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'subsection_name': 'Politics', 'byline': {'original': 'By Eileen Sullivan and Katie Benner', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Eileen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sullivan', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Katie', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Benner', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ee475504-3fc9-512d-930b-7fb701033784', 'word_count': 539, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ee475504-3fc9-512d-930b-7fb701033784'}, {'abstract': 'The French Army’s chief of staff called on soldiers who anonymously signed the letter to quit the armed forces.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/12/world/europe/france-letter-military-civil-war-warning.html', 'snippet': 'The French Army’s chief of staff called on soldiers who anonymously signed the letter to quit the armed forces.', 'lead_paragraph': 'PARIS — The French prime minister and the chief of staff of the army have condemned an  anonymous letter signed by people claiming to be active-duty troops warning about impending “civil war” in France.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/world/10france-military1/merlin_177314577_750745c6-815b-4793-bdd5-c77df1afe045-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/10/world/10france-military1/merlin_177314577_750745c6-815b-4793-bdd5-c77df1afe045-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/world/10france-military1/merlin_177314577_750745c6-815b-4793-bdd5-c77df1afe045-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/world/10france-military1/merlin_177314577_750745c6-815b-4793-bdd5-c77df1afe045-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/10/world/10france-military1/10france-military1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 7