us around the world.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/12/us/covid-hospital-cases-decline.html', 'snippet': 'The director of the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention said this week that while she was encouraged by the gains against the pandemic, Americans should remain vigilant to the threat of the virus around the world.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many of the states that have suffered the worst recent coronavirus outbreaks have seen notable declines both in new cases and in hospitalizations over the last two weeks, according to a New York Times database.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/11/us/11virus-briefing-us-infection-decline1/1virus-briefing-us-infection-decline1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/11/us/11virus-briefing-us-infection-decline1/1virus-briefing-us-infection-decline1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/11/us/11virus-briefing-us-infection-decline1/1virus-briefing-us-infection-decline1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/11/us/11virus-briefing-us-infection-decline1/1virus-briefing-us-infection-decline1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/11/us/11virus-briefing-us-infection-decline1/1virus-briefing-us-infection-decline1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnai