the early days of the pandemic posted a TikTok video of herself blissfully roller-skating down a wide, empty street while singing along to Jennifer Lopez’s song “Jenny From the Block.” The video has been viewed more than 17 million times and has been credited with prompting what would become a Covid-19 roller-skating boom. Once you get over the mental confusion caused by rolling backward, rear-facing skating is its own special kind of movement. “It’s more like dancing,” Coto says.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '17', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/16/magazine/16Mag-Tip-01/16Mag-Tip-01-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/16/magazine/16Mag-Tip-01/16Mag-Tip-01-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/16/magazine/16Mag-Tip-01/16Mag-Tip-01-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/16/magazine/16Mag-Tip-01/16Mag-Tip-01-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/16/magazine/16Mag-Tip-01/16Mag-Tip-01-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/16/magazine/16Mag-Tip-01/16Mag-Tip-01-thumbStandard-v2.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/16/magazine/16Mag