f38d', 'word_count': 1247, 'uri': 'nyt://article/9279ac48-fecd-5512-a35f-c05377c6f38d'}, {'abstract': 'Here are the plans for 27 productions so far, including old favorites, brand-new musicals and some that were just getting started.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/13/theater/broadway-reopening-guide.html', 'snippet': 'Here are the plans for 27 productions so far, including old favorites, brand-new musicals and some that were just getting started.', 'lead_paragraph': 'After being closed for more than a year, Broadway is showing signs of life. Several long-running musicals, including “The Lion King” and “Wicked,” have recently announced when they will reopen this fall. Shows that were just beginning their runs, and had not yet opened, when the pandemic struck — like “Six,” “Diana” and “Mrs. Doubtfire” — have also released their plans for resuming performances. The revival of “Caroline, or Change” and the new Michael Jackson biomusical “MJ” have taken their first steps toward welcoming audiences, as well.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/arts/13BROADWAY1/13BROADWAY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 788, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/14/arts/13BROADWAY1/13BROADWAY1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 788}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/arts/13BROADWAY1/13BROADWAY1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 780, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/arts/13BROADWAY1/13BROADWAY1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1559, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subt