ue': 'Demonstrations, Protests and Riots', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-13T22:19:10+0000', 'document_type': 'multimedia', 'news_desk': '', 'section_name': 'World', 'byline': {'original': 'By The Associated Press', 'person': [], 'organization': 'The Associated Press'}, 'type_of_material': 'Video', '_id': 'nyt://video/c57e5ab0-a75a-5756-90ac-158db1b5bb61', 'word_count': 0, 'uri': 'nyt://video/c57e5ab0-a75a-5756-90ac-158db1b5bb61'}, {'abstract': 'The C.D.C. said Thursday that vaccinated Americans no longer needed masks in most places. Other disease experts recently had a different message: that masks were necessary in public.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/13/upshot/epidemiologists-coronavirus-masks.html', 'snippet': 'The C.D.C. said Thursday that vaccinated Americans no longer needed masks in most places. Other disease experts recently had a different message: that masks were necessary in public.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When federal health officials said on Thursday that fully vaccinated Americans no longer needed to wear masks in most places, it came as a surprise to many people in public health. It also was a stark contrast with the views of a large majority of epidemiologists surveyed in the last two weeks by The New York Times.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/13/upshot/13up-virus/merlin_187331721_ab2830c4-8020-4e14-afa3-ad2a3408beef-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 425, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/13/upshot/13up-virus/merlin_187331721_ab2830c4-8020-4e14-afa3-ad2a3408beef-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 425}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/13/upshot/13up-virus/merlin_187331721_ab2830c4-8020-4e14-afa3-ad2a3408b