/5532e345-e3e9-5e06-9f2c-d7871de2456f'}, {'abstract': 'Under a deal with the military court, Majid Khan, who has admitted being a courier for Al Qaeda, will give up his chance to call witnesses to his torture in return for being released as soon as next year.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/14/us/politics/guantanamo-detainee-cia-testimony.html', 'snippet': 'Under a deal with the military court, Majid Khan, who has admitted being a courier for Al Qaeda, will give up his chance to call witnesses to his torture in return for being released as soon as next year.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WASHINGTON — A detainee at Guantánamo Bay has agreed to a deal intended to lead to his release in the next few years in return for giving up the right to question the C.I.A. in court about its torture program, United States government officials said.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/13/us/politics/13dc-gitmo1/merlin_153097917_c0691b5c-f660-44a3-b728-c36db6e8bd13-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 800, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/13/us/politics/13dc-gitmo1/merlin_153097917_c0691b5c-f660-44a3-b728-c36db6e8bd13-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 800}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/13/us/politics/13dc-gitmo1/merlin_153097917_c0691b5c-f660-44a3-b728-c36db6e8bd13-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 768, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/13/us/politics/13dc-gitmo1/merlin_153097917_c0691b5c-f660-44a3-b728-c36db6e8bd13-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1536, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'r