News', '_id': 'nyt://article/820e9971-9acd-5d33-90b1-f17e037c7744', 'word_count': 1584, 'uri': 'nyt://article/820e9971-9acd-5d33-90b1-f17e037c7744'}, {'abstract': 'When a rocket struck an Israeli border town, Ido Avigal, 5, was sheltering in a fortified safe room. But shrapnel still managed to puncture the thick window, killing him.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/14/world/middleeast/ido-avigal-israel-palestine-gaza.html', 'snippet': 'When a rocket struck an Israeli border town, Ido Avigal, 5, was sheltering in a fortified safe room. But shrapnel still managed to puncture the thick window, killing him.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SDEROT, Israel — It was 1:30 p.m. on Friday in Sderot, and Ido Avigal, 5, was being laid to rest a few miles to the north. He had been killed in what officials termed a freak incident two days earlier when a rocket from Gaza made a direct hit on the building next door to his aunt’s apartment, where he was visiting with his mother and older sister.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/world/14israel-scene-idd/merlin_186832299_f9acf617-fb1c-4f03-b51e-56d395cf7621-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 403, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/14/world/14israel-scene-idd/merlin_186832299_f9acf617-fb1c-4f03-b51e-56d395cf7621-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 403}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/world/14israel-scene-idd/merlin_186832299_f9acf617-fb1c-4f03-b51e-56d395cf7621-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 688, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/world/14israel-scene-idd/merlin_186832299_f9acf61