ticle on March 29 about climate change and steel companies referred incompletely to the gases converted by bacteria into useful chemicals in pilot programs by ArcelorMittal. Both carbon monoxide and carbon dioxide are converted, not carbon dioxide alone.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '15', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Corrections: May 15, 2021', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Corrections', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-05-15T02:55:20+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Corrections', 'section_name': 'Corrections', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Correction', '_id': 'nyt://article/db51039f-e437-539a-9b3a-f4dee04dc449', 'word_count': 115, 'uri': 'nyt://article/db51039f-e437-539a-9b3a-f4dee04dc449'}, {'abstract': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, May 15, 2021.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/14/todayspaper/quotation-of-the-day-pipeline-hack-reveals-seams-in-nations-cybersecurity-armor.html', 'snippet': 'Quotation of the Day for Saturday, May 15, 2021.', 'lead_paragraph': '“It’s all fun and games when we are stealing each other’s money. When we are messing with a society’s ability to operate, we can’t tolerate it.”', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '3', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Quotation of the Day: Pipeline Hack Reveals Seams in Nation’s Cybersecurity Armor', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Quote of the Day', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-05-15T02:56:50+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Summary', 'section_name': 'Today’s Paper', 'byline': {'original': '', 'person': [], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Quote', '_id': 'nyt://article/02cb041c-a85b-5100-ad1e-0cca2938ab56', 'word_count': 53, 'uri': 'nyt://article/02cb041c-a85b-5100-ad1e-0cca2938ab56'}, {'abstract': 'Andrea Pirlo was given a difficult task and failed at it. But if Juventus misses out on next season’s Champions League, it won’t be entirely his fault.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/15/sports/soccer/juventus-andrea-pirlo-serie-a.html', 'snippet': 'Andrea Pirlo was given a difficult task and failed at it. But if Juventus misses out on next season’s Champions League, it won’t be entirely his fault.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The jokes almost wrote themselves. Last summer, Juventus announced that it had installed Andrea Pirlo as coach of its under-23 team. It was a thoroughly sensible idea: the perfect place for a beloved former player to cut his teeth in a new phase of his career, the ideal spot for him to take his first job in management.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/sports/14rorynewsletter-pirlo2/merlin_187657854_bc87e744-7f39-47ad-aeb9-2e800b2b6cf8-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 423, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/14/sports/14rorynewsletter-pirlo2/merlin_187657854_bc87e744-7f39-47ad-aeb9-2e800b2b6cf8-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 423}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/sports/14rorynewsletter-pirlo2/merlin_187657854_bc87e744-7f39-47ad-aeb9-2e800b2b6cf8-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 722, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/14/sports/14rorynewsletter-pirlo2/merlin_187657854_bc87e744-7f39-47ad-aeb9-2e800b2b6cf8-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1444, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'th