harassment-investigation.html', 'snippet': 'Four women who have accused Gov. Andrew Cuomo of sexual misconduct have been formally asked to testify under oath.', 'lead_paragraph': 'ALBANY, N.Y. — Four women who have accused Gov. Andrew M. Cuomo of sexual harassment have received subpoenas to testify under oath, the latest indication that the state attorney general’s investigation into Mr. Cuomo’s behavior has entered a critical phase.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '21', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/16/nyregion/16cuomo-inquiries-print1/merlin_187565937_933cdefb-efe6-45d2-954f-325dafc5d037-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/16/nyregion/16cuomo-inquiries-print1/merlin_187565937_933cdefb-efe6-45d2-954f-325dafc5d037-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/16/nyregion/16cuomo-inquiries-print1/merlin_187565937_933cdefb-efe6-45d2-954f-325dafc5d037-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/16/nyregion/16cuomo-inquiries-print1/merlin_187565937_933cdefb-efe6-45d2-954f-325dafc5d037-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/16/nyregion/16cuomo-inquiries-print1/00cuomo-inquiries1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/16/nyregion/16cuomo-inquiries-print1/00cuomo-inquiries1-thumbStandard