b-126d-53da-a025-67d77183b5b5'}, {'abstract': 'Cut off from the power grid and with fuel costs soaring, Syrians in a poor, embattled enclave have turned en masse to solar panels to charge their phones and light their homes and tents.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/15/world/middleeast/syria-solar-power-idlib.html', 'snippet': 'Cut off from the power grid and with fuel costs soaring, Syrians in a poor, embattled enclave have turned en masse to solar panels to charge their phones and light their homes and tents.', 'lead_paragraph': 'HARANABUSH, Syria — When the Syrian government attacked their village, Radwan al-Shimali’s family hastily threw clothes, blankets and mattresses into their truck and sped off to begin new lives as refugees, leaving behind their house, farmland and television.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/world/00Syria-Solar-Dispatch1-promo/merlin_186159876_3f8099c1-25ea-45be-afc2-bd8a67454b5c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/04/27/world/00Syria-Solar-Dispatch1-promo/merlin_186159876_3f8099c1-25ea-45be-afc2-bd8a67454b5c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/world/00Syria-Solar-Dispatch1-promo/merlin_186159876_3f8099c1-25ea-45be-afc2-bd8a67454b5c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/04/27/world/00Syria-Solar-Dispatch1-promo/merlin_186159876_3f8099c1-25ea-45be-afc2-bd8a67454b5c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy':