.Q. history using contemporary articles, videos, photographs and The Times’s archive.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/17/learning/six-ways-to-learn-about-stonewall-using-the-new-york-times.html', 'snippet': 'Activities to help students learn about a significant moment in L.G.B.T.Q. history using contemporary articles, videos, photographs and The Times’s archive.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Next month is the 52nd anniversary of the Stonewall uprising. On June 28, 1969, police officers raided the Stonewall Inn, a gay bar in New York City, with the stated purpose of reprimanding unlicensed bars that were illegally selling alcohol. Police raids on gay bars at the time were routine; the raid on that evening in 1969, however, incited a protest that galvanized the modern gay rights movement.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/17/learning/17Stonewall2020LN/merlin_174050961_f105278c-fe23-4811-a3df-550b2496d547-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 370, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/17/learning/17Stonewall2020LN/merlin_174050961_f105278c-fe23-4811-a3df-550b2496d547-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 370}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/17/learning/17Stonewall2020LN/merlin_174050961_f105278c-fe23-4811-a3df-550b2496d547-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 631, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/17/learning/17Stonewall2020LN/merlin_174050961_f105278c-fe23-4811-a3df-550b2496d547-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1262, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'im