72db8e3d7b9'}, {'abstract': 'Only other people can force us to doubt the beliefs we hold dear. Descartes’s philosophical journey shows us why.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/17/special-series/agnes-callard-what-we-believe-about-skepticism.html', 'snippet': 'Only other people can force us to doubt the beliefs we hold dear. Descartes’s philosophical journey shows us why.', 'lead_paragraph': 'This personal reflection is part of a series called The Big Ideas, in which writers respond to a single question: What do we believe? You can read more essays by visiting The Big Ideas series page.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/17/multimedia/17bigideas-callard-5/merlin_179580990_40fef476-e0d5-4370-98f4-5dae90eee94a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/17/multimedia/17bigideas-callard-5/merlin_179580990_40fef476-e0d5-4370-98f4-5dae90eee94a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/17/multimedia/17bigideas-callard-5/merlin_179580990_40fef476-e0d5-4370-98f4-5dae90eee94a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/17/multimedia/17bigideas-callard-5/merlin_179580990_40fef476-e0d5-4370-98f4-5dae90eee94a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/17/multimedia/17bigideas-callard-5/merlin_179580990_40fef476-e0d5-4370-98f4-5dae90eee94a-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': '