tor Mather', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Victor', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Mather', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/a2f27cb4-9d64-5966-b167-7c6c1e0c16b4', 'word_count': 456, 'uri': 'nyt://article/a2f27cb4-9d64-5966-b167-7c6c1e0c16b4'}, {'abstract': 'The retailer expressed optimism after sales soared 56 percent in the first quarter, raising its forecast for the year as consumers begin to buy apparel for get-togethers.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/18/business/macys-first-quarter-earnings.html', 'snippet': 'The retailer expressed optimism after sales soared 56 percent in the first quarter, raising its forecast for the year as consumers begin to buy apparel for get-togethers.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A combination of government stimulus and faster-than-expected vaccinations drove a sales rebound at Macy’s over the past three months, in what could signal the start of a post-pandemic shopping boom.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/18/business/18econ-brf-macys/merlin_187757793_04258fdc-1d10-4563-a4a4-5a1d0c89539c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/18/business/18econ-brf-macys/merlin_187757793_04258fdc-1d10-4563-a4a4-5a1d0c89539c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/18/business/18econ-brf-macys/merlin_187757793_04258fdc-1d10-4563-a4a4-5a1d0c89539c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images