times.com/2021/05/18/arts/dance/Being-a-Ballerina-Gavin-Larsen.html', 'snippet': 'For Gavin Larsen, the author of “Being a Ballerina,” the drama of a life spent in dance is the dancing. Period.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Gavin Larsen said she first felt like a writer in 2015 at an artists’ residency in New Mexico. She was there, not as a dancer, but to work on a book about her dancing career. And she was surrounded by musicians, writers and visual artists who didn’t know a thing about ballet.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/arts/18gavin-larsen-1/merlin_187869654_ad2ba3b7-edd1-457d-9bad-647f45d2e835-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/19/arts/18gavin-larsen-1/merlin_187869654_ad2ba3b7-edd1-457d-9bad-647f45d2e835-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/arts/18gavin-larsen-1/merlin_187869654_ad2ba3b7-edd1-457d-9bad-647f45d2e835-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/arts/18gavin-larsen-1/merlin_187869654_ad2ba3b7-edd1-457d-9bad-647f45d2e835-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/arts/18gavin-larsen-1/18gavin-larsen-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/19/arts/18gavin-larsen-1/18gavin-larsen-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth'