d a pandemic-related appetite to be closer to the water.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/18/business/australia-coastal-development.html', 'snippet': 'Coastal developments around Australia are booming thanks to population growth and a pandemic-related appetite to be closer to the water.', 'lead_paragraph': 'On the coast of Western Australia, the city of Busselton awaits the arrival of a 3,000-ton whale made of concrete and steel, breaching from the depths of the Indian Ocean.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/business/18Jetties-01/merlin_187888140_12eceffa-27a4-4897-8daa-855394df0a99-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/19/business/18Jetties-01/merlin_187888140_12eceffa-27a4-4897-8daa-855394df0a99-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/business/18Jetties-01/merlin_187888140_12eceffa-27a4-4897-8daa-855394df0a99-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 684, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/business/18Jetties-01/merlin_187888140_12eceffa-27a4-4897-8daa-855394df0a99-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/business/18Jetties-01/merlin_187888140_12eceffa-27a4-4897-8daa-855394df0a99-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/19/business/18Jetties-01/merlin_187888140_12eceffa-27a4-4897-8daa-855394df0a99-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/business/18Jetties-01/merlin_187888140_12eceffa-27a4-4897-8daa-855394df0a99-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'As More Australians Migrate to the Coast, Development Follows', 'kicker': 'Square Feet', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'What This Town Needs Is a Concrete Whale', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Economic Conditions and Trends', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Real Estate (Commercial)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Eco-Tourism', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'ARCHITECTURE', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-18T19:00:13+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Business', 'section_name': 'Business Day', 'byline': {'original': 'By Will Higginbotham', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Will', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Higginbotham', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/869c1f21-51eb-529a-be54-32cbc9df31f4', 'word_count': 1254, 'uri': 'nyt://article/869c1f21-51eb-529a-be54-32cbc9df31f4'}, {'abstract': 'In this short film, the family of one of Spain’s earliest Covid-19 patients chronicles his battle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/18/opinion/57-days-covid-spain.html', 'snippet': 'In this short film, the family of one of Spain’s earliest Covid-19 patients chronicles his battle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In late February 2020, my father was admitted to a hospital outside Madrid with difficulty breathing. A day later, he was induced into a coma. He had no idea that he was one of the first people to be infected with the coronavirus in Spain. After 57 days of fighting for his life, he woke up with many questions about what happened to him and what our family had gone through.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'My Father Was in a Coma for 57 Days. He Awoke to a Pandemic.', 'kicker': 'Op-Docs', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Documentary Films and Programs', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Spain', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Madrid (Spain)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-18T19:00:48+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'OpEd', 'section_name': 'Opinion', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mario Lumbreras and Laura Brasero', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mario', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Lumbreras', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Laura', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Brasero', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'Op-Ed', '_id': 'nyt://article/4cb09d5d-f8af-5945-8666-ad8124ed3b8e', 'word_count': 201, 'uri': 'nyt://article/4cb09d5d-f8af-5945-8666-ad8124ed3b8e'}, {'abstract': 'The effectiveness of U.S. sanctions is being called into question as Iran and its oil buyers test whether penalties are worth the risk amid diplomatic negotiations.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/18/us/politics/iran-oil-exports-nuclear-accord.html', 'snippet': 'The effectiveness of U.S. sanctions is being called into question as Iran and 