}, {'abstract': 'Viking plans to release “Silverview,” a spy novel set in an English seaside town, nearly a year after the famed writer’s death.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/19/books/john-le-carre-silverview.html', 'snippet': 'Viking plans to release “Silverview,” a spy novel set in an English seaside town, nearly a year after the famed writer’s death.', 'lead_paragraph': 'When John le Carré died last year at 89, he had published 25 novels over the span of six decades, and he was still writing. He left one complete, full-length novel behind.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '6', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/books/19Lecarre/merlin_161001789_d0aa30cd-7387-4f24-a7f2-f8817a8508b3-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 480, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/19/books/19Lecarre/merlin_161001789_d0aa30cd-7387-4f24-a7f2-f8817a8508b3-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 480}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/books/19Lecarre/merlin_161001789_d0aa30cd-7387-4f24-a7f2-f8817a8508b3-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 819, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/books/19Lecarre/merlin_161001789_d0aa30cd-7387-4f24-a7f2-f8817a8508b3-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1638, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/books/19Lecarre/19Lecarre-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/19/books/19Lecarre/19Lecarre-thumbStandard