gle.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/19/theater/drama-book-shop-lin-manuel-miranda.html', 'snippet': 'The quirky bookstore, which sells scripts and other theater-related work, was acquired by a team of “Hamilton” alumni after years of struggle.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The Drama Book Shop, a quirky 104-year-old Manhattan specialty store that has long been a haven for aspiring artists as well as a purveyor of scripts, will reopen next month with a new location, a new look, and a new team of starry owners.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/arts/19dramabookshop/merlin_104968084_b7e83926-95c4-4723-a8e8-8a8bac533fe9-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/19/arts/19dramabookshop/merlin_104968084_b7e83926-95c4-4723-a8e8-8a8bac533fe9-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/arts/19dramabookshop/merlin_104968084_b7e83926-95c4-4723-a8e8-8a8bac533fe9-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/arts/19dramabookshop/merlin_104968084_b7e83926-95c4-4723-a8e8-8a8bac533fe9-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/arts/19dramabookshop/19dramabookshop-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/19/arts/19dramabookshop/19dramabookshop-thumbStandard.jp