1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/dining/13ottorex/merlin_187538172_91160c90-7a82-4562-a2a7-654379de8c63-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/19/dining/13ottorex/merlin_187538172_91160c90-7a82-4562-a2a7-654379de8c63-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/19/dining/13ottorex/merlin_187538172_91160c90-7a82-4562-a2a7-654379de8c63-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'What to Cook Right Now', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [], 'pub_date': '2021-05-19T14:30:01+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Dining', 'section_name': 'Food', 'byline': {'original': 'By Sam Sifton', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Sam', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Sifton', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab992d9a-e5fe-50fe-8a4f-0e047f0c6fe4', 'word_count': 680, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab992d9a-e5fe-50fe-8a4f-0e047f0c6fe4'}, {'abstract': 'After a traumatic year, it’s hard to simply flip a switch toward fun. But have teenage summers ever lived up to expectations?', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/19/magazine/summer2021-teens.html', 'snippet': 'After a traumatic year, it’s hard to simply flip a switch toward fun. But have teenage summers ever lived up to expectations?', 'lead_paragraph': '“All I want is THIS type of summer this year,” the caption reads, as a teenage girl on TikTok sways to the Kings of Leon song “Sex on Fire.” She covers her mouth like she’s about to happy-cry, and then the video cuts to a hyperfast montage of images, many inflected with a grainy, disposable-camera quality that suggests the past. I can make out: girls on bikes, sparklers at a bonfire, someone drinking wine from a bottle, a picnic blanket at a beach, the neon sign for a late-night diner, a red plastic Solo cup in someone’s hand, the trappings of a sleepover, someone dancing on a table, a rosebush in a rainstorm. It is over so quickly that it feels like one long, blurred vibe, nostalgia at high speed. “I think we all deserve it this year,” she writes, at the bottom of the video, along with #summer #summer2021.', 'print_section': 'MM', 'print_page': '11', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/magazine/23mag-screenland/23mag-screenland-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/23/magazine/23mag-screenland/23mag-screenland-articleLarge-v2.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/magazine/23mag-screenland/23mag-screenland-jumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/magazine/23mag-screenland/23mag-screenland-superJumbo-v2.jpg', 'height': 1044, 'width': 1567, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/magazine/23mag-screenland/23mag-screenland-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard'