ctory worker, a retiree, two community organizers — sat on kitchen chairs discussing their next move: recruiting for a boycott.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '13', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/18/us/00kentucky-1/merlin_187654098_d2334a3d-0537-49fb-8dba-d278140c36e1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/18/us/00kentucky-1/merlin_187654098_d2334a3d-0537-49fb-8dba-d278140c36e1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/18/us/00kentucky-1/merlin_187654098_d2334a3d-0537-49fb-8dba-d278140c36e1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/18/us/00kentucky-1/merlin_187654098_d2334a3d-0537-49fb-8dba-d278140c36e1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1366, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/18/us/00kentucky-1/merlin_187654098_d2334a3d-0537-49fb-8dba-d278140c36e1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/18/us/00kentucky-1/merlin_187654098_d2334a3d-0537-49fb-8dba-d278140c36e1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/18/us/00kentucky-1/merlin_187654098_d2334a3d-0537-49fb-8dba-d278140c36e1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}