ects “a profound change in my thinking.”', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/20/technology/tech-antitrust-paul-romer.html', 'snippet': 'Paul Romer’s call for government activism, particularly toward the big tech companies, reflects “a profound change in my thinking.”', 'lead_paragraph': 'Paul Romer was once Silicon Valley’s favorite economist. The theory that helped him win a Nobel prize — that ideas are the turbocharged fuel of the modern economy — resonated deeply in the global capital of wealth-generating ideas. In the 1990s, Wired magazine called him “an economist for the technological age.” The Wall Street Journal said the tech industry treated him “like a rock star.”', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/21/business/00romer/merlin_187121226_e2034fb9-4076-46c0-95e8-ac70a4feb6cc-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 750, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/21/business/00romer/merlin_187121226_e2034fb9-4076-46c0-95e8-ac70a4feb6cc-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 750}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/21/business/00romer/merlin_187121226_e2034fb9-4076-46c0-95e8-ac70a4feb6cc-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 820, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/21/business/00romer/merlin_187121226_e2034fb9-4076-46c0-95e8-ac70a4feb6cc-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1639, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/21/business/00romer/00romer-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTy