ebd8d1-fcb3-5c68-ab11-876b4a0430db'}, {'abstract': 'Growing up, Sade’s music had always given Emily Shakeshaft a feeling of comfort. Years later, when she met the recording artist’s son, Izaak Theo Adu-Watts, their connection felt familiar.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/20/style/Sade-son-Izaak-Adu-Watts-marries-Emily-Shakeshaft.html', 'snippet': 'Growing up, Sade’s music had always given Emily Shakeshaft a feeling of comfort. Years later, when she met the recording artist’s son, Izaak Theo Adu-Watts, their connection felt familiar.', 'lead_paragraph': 'The soundtrack of Emily Margaret Shakeshaft’s childhood became a means of comfort and grounding as she grew older. One of the songs in that soundtrack that her mother curated was “Babyfather” by the Grammy Award-winning singer Sade. As fate would have it, Sade’s son, Izaak Theo Adu-Watts, sang on that track, and, on April 16, Ms. Shakeshaft married Mr. Adu-Watts.', 'print_section': 'ST', 'print_page': '12', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/fashion/20Vows-SadeSonHawaii1/merlin_186659007_5f7dc7b6-da7b-404c-a712-54e1a823e44c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/23/fashion/20Vows-SadeSonHawaii1/merlin_186659007_5f7dc7b6-da7b-404c-a712-54e1a823e44c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/fashion/20Vows-SadeSonHawaii1/merlin_186659007_5f7dc7b6-da7b-404c-a712-54e1a823e44c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/fashion/20Vows-SadeSonHawaii1/merlin_186659007_5f7dc7b6-da7b-404c-a712-54e1a823e44c-su