rk, a fierce, feminist look at objectification at Abrons Arts Center’s outdoor Amphitheater.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/21/arts/dance/molly-lieber-eleanor-smith-gloria-review.html', 'snippet': 'Molly Lieber and Eleanor Smith present their latest work, a fierce, feminist look at objectification at Abrons Arts Center’s outdoor Amphitheater.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Since they began collaborating together 15 years ago, Molly Lieber and Eleanor Smith have made dances that explored trauma — slow, delicate, intimate portraits of women, by turns innocent and knowing. Some were in silence, others included text; often Lieber and Smith performed nude, yet it was the kind of sustained nudity that made you forget they were naked. The way their bodies locked into the same vibration or rhythm or mood was more phenomenal than their physicality.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/22/arts/21lieber-smith-1/merlin_188006208_4fd6f994-a95a-4314-992c-0890aa0250c2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 418, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/22/arts/21lieber-smith-1/merlin_188006208_4fd6f994-a95a-4314-992c-0890aa0250c2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 418}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/22/arts/21lieber-smith-1/merlin_188006208_4fd6f994-a95a-4314-992c-0890aa0250c2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 714, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/22/arts/21lieber-smith-1/merlin_188006208_4fd6f994-a95a-4314-992c-0890aa0250c2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1427, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'ran