, 'byline': {'original': 'By John Henderson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'John', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Henderson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/e20cf853-082e-5324-bd4b-291c8843174b', 'word_count': 1267, 'uri': 'nyt://article/e20cf853-082e-5324-bd4b-291c8843174b'}, {'abstract': 'This week the police disinterred a body, found on a beach in 1948, that has puzzled investigators for decades. “There’s lots of twists and turns in this case, and every turn is pretty weird,” one said.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/22/world/australia/who-was-somerton-man.html', 'snippet': 'This week the police disinterred a body, found on a beach in 1948, that has puzzled investigators for decades. “There’s lots of twists and turns in this case, and every turn is pretty weird,” one said.', 'lead_paragraph': 'No one knows how the so-called Somerton man, found well-dressed and dead with a half-smoked cigarette on his lapel, wound up on the beach in South Australia where he was found. No one knows what he was doing there, or even how he died.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/22xp-somertonman1-print/merlin_187972392_279fd607-318e-4965-86ed-9d6246c9e7e6-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 398, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/22xp-somertonman1-print/merlin_187972392_279fd607-318e-4965-86ed-9d6246c9e7e6-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 398}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/22xp-somertonman1-print/merlin_187972392_279fd607-318e-4965-86ed-9d6246c9e7e6-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 679, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/22xp-somertonman1-print/merlin_187972392_279fd607-318e-4965-86ed-9d6246c9e7e6-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1358, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/22xp-somertonman1-print/22xp-somertonman-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/22xp-somertonman1-print/22xp-somertonman-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/22xp-somertonman1-print/22xp-somertonman-1-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Australia Exhumes the Somerton Man, and His 70-Year Mystery', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Australia Exhumes Somerton Man, Seeking DNA in Mystery From 70 Years Ago', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Forensic Science', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'DNA (Deoxyribonucleic Acid)', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Adelaide (Australia)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Australia', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-22T16:32:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Australia', 'byline': {'original': 'By Alan Yuhas', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Alan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Yuhas', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/c176582a-248e-5c0d-992f-ddfe55ef2274', 'word_count': 1373, 'uri': 'nyt://article/c176582a-248e-5c0d-992f-ddfe55ef2274'}, {'abstract': 'As a top executive at the Andrews McMeel syndicate, she played a key role in the careers of Tom Wilson, Cathy Guisewite and Garry Trudeau.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/22/business/media/kathleen-andrews-dead.html', 'snippet': 'As a top executive at the Andrews McMeel syndicate, she played a key role in the careers of Tom Wilson, Cathy Guisewite and Garry Trudeau.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Kathleen Andrews was missing her husband, Jim, who had been on the road for weeks trying to drum up interest in his new company, a syndication business, when she came across a little gift book titled “When You’re Not Around.” It featured a hapless, hairless, pantless and as yet unnamed character — a hard-luck antihero whose wan exploits fit her blue mood.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '10', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/books/21Andrews-Combo/21Andrews-Combo-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 256, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/25/books/21Andrews-Combo/21Andrews-Combo-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 256}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/books/21Andrews-Combo/21Andrews-Combo-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 437, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/books/21Andrews-Combo/21Andrews-Combo-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 874, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtyp