e': 'Get Wet  This Summer!', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Sailboats and Sailing', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Water', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Swimming', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantine (Life and Culture)', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Travel and Vacations', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Boats and Boating', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Kayaks', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Lakes', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Content Type: Service', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-23T03:22:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'AtHome', 'section_name': 'At Home', 'byline': {'original': 'By Megan Michelson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Megan', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Michelson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/df501b3f-046c-508d-a927-14acc30a28d8', 'word_count': 1433, 'uri': 'nyt://article/df501b3f-046c-508d-a927-14acc30a28d8'}, {'abstract': 'As productions and festivals reopen this summer, it will be nice to experience some drama outside of our own.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/22/at-home/live-theater-returns.html', 'snippet': 'As productions and festivals reopen this summer, it will be nice to experience some drama outside of our own.', 'lead_paragraph': 'As vaccinations and an announcement by the Centers for Disease Control and Prevention have caused many to reduce their mask use, live performances are slowly returning. While Broadway’s official return is not until September, Radio City Music Hall will reopen on June 19 to host the final night of the Tribeca Film Festival (guests must be vaccinated). And across the New York, venues like the Park Avenue Armory and St. Ann’s Warehouse are already experimenting with socially distanced outdoor performances to resuscitate live theater with caution.', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '8', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/23ah-THEATER/23ah-THEATER-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 600, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/23ah-THEATER/23ah-THEATER-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 600}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/23ah-THEATER/23ah-THEATER-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 900, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/23ah-THEATER/23ah-THEATER-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 900, 'width': 900, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/23ah-THEATER/23ah-THEATER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/23ah-THEATER/23ah-THEATER-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/23ah-THEATER/23ah-THEATER-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Enjoy the Thrill of Live Theater', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': 'Rediscover The Thrill of Live Theater', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Quarantine (Life and Culture)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Theater', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Summer (Season)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Music', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus Reopenings', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Content Type: Service', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-23T03:41:11+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'AtHome', 'section_name': 'At Home', 'byline': {'original': 'By Adrienne Gaffney', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Adrienne', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Gaffney', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/5423cd59-f021-532c-8fc3-cbe26ff81077', 'word_count': 664, 'uri': 'nyt://article/5423cd59-f021-532c-8fc3-cbe26ff81077'}, {'abstract': 'These fun cake decorations will create a whirl at your next party.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/22/at-home/pinwheel-activity.html', 'snippet': 'These fun cake decorations will create a whirl at your next party.', 'lead_paragraph': 'You don’t need to be an expert with a pastry bag to decorate a cake. Make these simple paper pinwheels using the newspaper you’re holding, and poke them into the top of your cake or cupcakes. Newsprint is the perfect lightweight paper to catch a breeze at your outdoor celebration and create some whirly magic. Pinwheels double as entertainment and favors for kids — and grown-ups — as  they run through the party with outstretched arms. ', 'print_section': 'D', 'print_page': '9', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/23/multimedia/23ah-pinwheel-activity2/23ah-pinwheel-activity2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width