ri': 'nyt://article/a5c5aaaa-048f-5628-a152-1cda6030ea76'}, {'abstract': 'Israel has quietly sought, and perhaps achieved, a large measure of autonomy from its half-century of reliance on the United States.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/24/world/middleeast/Israel-American-support.html', 'snippet': 'Israel has quietly sought, and perhaps achieved, a large measure of autonomy from its half-century of reliance on the United States.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Israel, a small country surrounded by adversaries and locked in conflict with the Palestinians, depends absolutely on American diplomatic and military support. By giving it, the United States safeguards Israel and wields significant leverage over its actions.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/24/world/24int-mideast1/merlin_187811751_d73f798d-cc9e-465d-9c84-012e6d2d3e1a-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/24/world/24int-mideast1/merlin_187811751_d73f798d-cc9e-465d-9c84-012e6d2d3e1a-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/24/world/24int-mideast1/merlin_187811751_d73f798d-cc9e-465d-9c84-012e6d2d3e1a-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/24/world/24int-mideast1/merlin_187811751_d73f798d-cc9e-465d-9c84-012e6d2d3e1a-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/24/world/24int-mideast1/24i