uri': 'nyt://article/73d49a3c-081d-5aac-839d-6814cf2daa65'}, {'abstract': 'There was much fanfare in 1975 when Bob Watson scored baseball’s millionth run. With baseball’s historical stats in flux, the two millionth will score on Saturday without much fuss.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/25/sports/baseball/2-million-runs.html', 'snippet': 'There was much fanfare in 1975 when Bob Watson scored baseball’s millionth run. With baseball’s historical stats in flux, the two millionth will score on Saturday without much fuss.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For 145 years, players have stepped, slid, walked, tumbled and jumped on white rubber slabs all over the continent. It is the act of scoring a run, the objective of baseball, and it is adding up to an impending milestone.', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/sports/25mlb-2millionruns-a/merlin_187717374_c3d18d7f-3b1d-412d-b2d1-49b96431c38e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/25/sports/25mlb-2millionruns-a/merlin_187717374_c3d18d7f-3b1d-412d-b2d1-49b96431c38e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/sports/25mlb-2millionruns-a/merlin_187717374_c3d18d7f-3b1d-412d-b2d1-49b96431c38e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/sports/25mlb-2millionruns-a/merlin_187717374_c3d18d7f-3b1d-412d-b2d1-49b96431c38e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1367, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'cre