b745-2dfde13cfed0'}, {'abstract': 'The U.S., which has a surplus of vaccines, could soon have two options for teens while many countries face shortages.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/25/health/coronavirus-moderna-vaccine-adolescents.html', 'snippet': 'The U.S., which has a surplus of vaccines, could soon have two options for teens while many countries face shortages.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Moderna said on Tuesday that its coronavirus vaccine, authorized only for use in adults, was powerfully effective in 12- to 17-year-olds. In a clinical trial of the vaccine in adolescents, there were no cases of symptomatic Covid-19 among fully vaccinated teens, the company reported in a news release.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '4', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/science/25virus-moderna-adolescents1/25virus-moderna-adolescents1-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/25/science/25virus-moderna-adolescents1/25virus-moderna-adolescents1-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/science/25virus-moderna-adolescents1/25virus-moderna-adolescents1-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 682, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/science/25virus-moderna-adolescents1/25virus-moderna-adolescents1-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1364, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/science/25virus-moderna-adolescents1/25virus-moderna-adolescents1-thumbStandard.