ng most breakthrough infections among fully vaccinated individuals.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/25/us/coronavirus-today-vaccines.html', 'snippet': 'The C.D.C. stopped investigating most breakthrough infections among fully vaccinated individuals.', 'lead_paragraph': 'It has been five months since the first Covid-19 vaccine was administered in the U.S., and so far the data on vaccinations suggests that they are highly effective. Breakthrough infections, which happen after a person is fully vaccinated, are few and far between.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/multimedia/25coronavirus-nl/25coronavirus-nl-articleLarge.png', 'height': 492, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/25/multimedia/25coronavirus-nl/25coronavirus-nl-articleLarge.png', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 492}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/multimedia/25coronavirus-nl/25coronavirus-nl-jumbo.png', 'height': 840, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/multimedia/25coronavirus-nl/25coronavirus-nl-superJumbo.png', 'height': 1024, 'width': 1248, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/multimedia/25coronavirus-nl/25coronavirus-nl-thumbStandard.png', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/25/multimedia/25coronavirus-nl/25coronavirus-nl-thumbStandard.png', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': No