etence that caused tens of thousands of extra Covid deaths.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/26/world/europe/cummings-johnson-covid.html', 'snippet': 'In parliamentary testimony, the former top aide accused the British prime minister of incompetence that caused tens of thousands of extra Covid deaths.', 'lead_paragraph': 'LONDON — He suggested that a doctor inject him with the coronavirus live on television to play down the dangers to a nervous public. He modeled himself after the small-town mayor in the movie “Jaws,” who ignored warnings to close the beaches even though there was a marauding shark offshore. As the pandemic closed in on Britain, he was distracted by an unflattering story about his fiancée and her dog.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': '‘Lions Led by Donkeys’: Cummings Unloads on Johnson Government', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '‘Lions Led by Donkeys’: Britain Was Failed by Johnson’s Team, Ex-Aide Says', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Coronavirus (2019-nCoV)', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Johnson, Boris', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Cummings, Dominic (1971- )', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Great Britain', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-26T18:08:35+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Foreign', 'section_name': 'World', 'subsection_name': 'Europe', 'byline': {'original': 'By Mark Landler and Stephen Castle', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Mark', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Landler', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}, {'firstname': 'Stephen', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Castle', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 2}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News',