er debut picture book is a best seller, but the road to get there wasn’t always easy.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/27/books/review/eyes-that-kiss-in-the-corners-joanna-ho.html', 'snippet': 'Her debut picture book is a best seller, but the road to get there wasn’t always easy.', 'lead_paragraph': 'NEW VIEW Talking to a writer who has vaulted onto the best-seller list is a bit like listening to an Olympian who has just won a gold medal. There’s a certain celebratory flurry, a dependable repetition of the word “surreal” and, as with an athlete’s appreciation for a coach, an abiding sense of gratitude for the editor and agent who helped lift an author onto this literary podium.', 'print_section': 'BR', 'print_page': '64', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06Insidethelist-web/06Insidethelist-print-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 899, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06Insidethelist-web/06Insidethelist-print-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 899}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06Insidethelist-web/06Insidethelist-print-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 684, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06Insidethelist-web/06Insidethelist-print-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1606, 'width': 1072, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06Insidethelist-web/06Insidethelist-print-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_