ber parties. There would be five or six girls camped out in sleeping bags before a TV set, clinging to each other, wet-the-bed terrified. This collective experience of horror created a strong bond between us. It was the 12-year-old-girl version of going to war: If we could make it through the Chucky franchise, we could make it through anything.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-HORROR-Sub01/06SummerReading-HORROR-Sub01-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 401, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-HORROR-Sub01/06SummerReading-HORROR-Sub01-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 401}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-HORROR-Sub01/06SummerReading-HORROR-Sub01-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 685, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-HORROR-Sub01/06SummerReading-HORROR-Sub01-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1369, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-HORROR-Sub01/06SummerReading-HORROR-Sub01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-HORROR-Sub01/06SummerReading-HORROR-Sub01-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/0