nd the performing arts.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/27/books/new-hollywood-broadway-books.html', 'snippet': 'New titles — about Lorraine Hansberry, “Midnight Cowboy” and more — get to the heart of our enduring obsessions with Hollywood and the performing arts.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Long before he became the celebrated filmmaker of “Sunset Boulevard,” “Some Like It Hot” and “The Apartment,” a young Billy Wilder worked briefly as a dancer for hire in the ballroom of a fashionable Berlin hotel. As he described the endeavor — one that called for a certain amount of imagination and role-playing in its own right — for a German newspaper in 1927, “This is no easy way to earn your daily bread, nor is it the kind that sentimental, softhearted types can stomach. But others can live from it.”', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 420, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 420}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 716, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1433, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN/06SummerReading-STAGE_SCREEN-thumbLarge.jpg', 'height': 150, 'width': 150, 'subType': 'thumbLarge', 'crop_name': 'thumbLarge', 'legacy': {}}], 'headline': {'main': 'Showbiz Books for Summer', 'kicker': 'Pop culture', 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Books and Literature', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Movies', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Billy Wilder on Assignment: Dispatches from Weimar Berlin and Interwar Vienna (Book)', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Isenberg, Noah', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Shooting Midnight Cowboy: Art, Sex, Loneliness, Liberation, and the Making of a Dark Classic (Book)', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Frankel, Glenn', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Footnotes: The Black Artists Who Rewrote the Rules of the Great White Way (Book)', 'rank': 7, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Gaines, Caseen', 'rank': 8, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Elizabeth and Monty: The Untold Story of Their Intimate Friendship (Book)', 'rank': 9, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Casillo, Charles (Author)', 'rank': 10, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Radical Vision: A Biography Of Lorraine Hansberry (Book)', 'rank': 11, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Colbert, Soyica Diggs', 'rank': 12, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Inside Comedy: The Soul, Wit, and Bite of Comedy and Comedians of the Last Five Decades (Book)', 'rank': 13, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Steinberg, David (Comedian)', 'rank': 14, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'creative_works', 'value': 'Trejo: My Life of Crime, Redemption and Hollywood (Book)', 'rank': 15, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Trejo, Danny', 'rank': 16, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-27T13:55:12+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'BookReview', 'section_name': 'Books', 'byline': {'original': 'By Dave Itzkoff', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Dave', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Itzkoff', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/ab9dd9db-7678-5d2b-9c23-884ebd422122', 'word_count': 2600, 'uri': 'nyt://article/ab9dd9db-7678-5d2b-9c23-884ebd422122'}, {'abstract': 'Alex Michaelides’s long-awaited next novel, “The Maidens,” is finally here, and so are new books from Catherine Steadman, Ben Winters and Geling Yan.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/27/books/new-thrillers.html', 'snippet': 'Alex Michaelides’s long-awaited next novel, “The Maidens,” is finally here, and so are new books from Catherine Steadman, Ben Winters and Geling Yan.', 'lead_paragraph': 'What better way to relax during the coming months than with a stack of juicy thrillers? Here you will find murders, ghosts, psychological intrigue, legal disputes and domestic dramas — a book for every mood.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/06/06/books/review/06SummerReading-THRILLERS/06SummerReading-THRILLERS-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 427, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy':