om/2021/05/27/world/europe/poland-covid-vaccine-skepticism.html', 'snippet': 'The mayor of a former mining community in Poland received death threats and was compared to a Nazi death camp doctor after trying to make coronavirus shots obligatory for adults.', 'lead_paragraph': 'WALBRZYCH, Poland — The mayor, a heart surgeon, had just finished overnight hospital duty when he received alarming news: a mob of protesters, some dressed in military camouflage, had gathered outside his home, screaming abuse through bullhorns and waving banners comparing him to Josef Mengele, the Nazi death camp physician.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/world/xxvirus-poland01/merlin_188281509_965d2018-4f6b-467e-8e4d-8925236292c0-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/25/world/xxvirus-poland01/merlin_188281509_965d2018-4f6b-467e-8e4d-8925236292c0-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/world/xxvirus-poland01/merlin_188281509_965d2018-4f6b-467e-8e4d-8925236292c0-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/world/xxvirus-poland01/merlin_188281509_965d2018-4f6b-467e-8e4d-8925236292c0-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/25/world/xxvirus-poland01/merlin_188281509_965d2018-4f6b-467e-8e4d-8925236292c0-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumb