f-2ef6-5e19-9cbf-9174805b9620'}, {'abstract': 'After Covid, a better life is possible.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/27/opinion/coronavirus-masks-vaccine.html', 'snippet': 'After Covid, a better life is possible.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For millions of Americans, the next six months are going to be great. The power Covid had over our lives is shrinking, and the power we have over our own lives is growing. The image that comes to mind is recess. We’ve been stuck emotionally indoors for over a year. Now we get to sprint down the hallway and burst into the playground of life.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '18', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/opinion/27brooks-lead/merlin_175127310_2661b984-bb9e-4ad6-a4ea-3973f28ef80e-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 400, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/27/opinion/27brooks-lead/merlin_175127310_2661b984-bb9e-4ad6-a4ea-3973f28ef80e-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 400}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/opinion/27brooks-lead/merlin_175127310_2661b984-bb9e-4ad6-a4ea-3973f28ef80e-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 683, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/opinion/27brooks-lead/merlin_175127310_2661b984-bb9e-4ad6-a4ea-3973f28ef80e-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1365, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/opinion/27brooks-lead/27brooks-lead-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbna