unt': 1726, 'uri': 'nyt://article/71b023d0-b312-5f65-a28b-5d4c0bb6aebd'}, {'abstract': 'As the United States withdraws its forces from Afghanistan, a former Marine who became a Times reporter sees only traces of what several camps used to be.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/28/insider/leaving-afghan-bases.html', 'snippet': 'As the United States withdraws its forces from Afghanistan, a former Marine who became a Times reporter sees only traces of what several camps used to be.', 'lead_paragraph': 'In 2008, I was a Marine lance corporal. I was 20 years old. I graduated from high school in 2006. George W. Bush was president. I owned an iPod and a flip phone. It was my first deployment to Afghanistan. I wanted to buy the new Weezer album (the “Red Album,” featuring “Pork and Beans”) and watch “Forgetting Sarah Marshall” when I got back.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '2', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/28/world/14atwar-newsletter-3/merlin_29428900_93e2195c-9a1f-4b83-9034-a76451a6332c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 357, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/28/world/14atwar-newsletter-3/merlin_29428900_93e2195c-9a1f-4b83-9034-a76451a6332c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 357}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/28/world/14atwar-newsletter-3/merlin_29428900_93e2195c-9a1f-4b83-9034-a76451a6332c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 609, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/28/world/14atwar-newsletter-3/merlin_29428900_93e2195c-9a1f-4b83-9034-a76451a6332c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1217, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'l