acks the spiral of decisions behind human exploits.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/28/theater/touching-the-void-review.html', 'snippet': 'This Bristol Old Vic production, based on the harrowing story of the British mountaineer Joe Simpson, tracks the spiral of decisions behind human exploits.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Many movies, books or shows are metaphorical slogs. The play “Touching the Void” is about a literal one: the slow, agonizing crawl of the British mountaineer Joe Simpson as he tried to return to his base camp after sustaining a gruesome injury on an Andes peak.', 'print_section': 'C', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/arts/27touching-void1/merlin_188391684_6e4baf3d-ff53-4156-8651-80d2fb23c4a7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 473, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/27/arts/27touching-void1/merlin_188391684_6e4baf3d-ff53-4156-8651-80d2fb23c4a7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 473}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/arts/27touching-void1/merlin_188391684_6e4baf3d-ff53-4156-8651-80d2fb23c4a7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 808, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/arts/27touching-void1/merlin_188391684_6e4baf3d-ff53-4156-8651-80d2fb23c4a7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1615, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/arts/27touching-void1/merlin_188391684_6e4baf3d-ff53-4156-8651-80d2fb23c4a7-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name'