 Mollie Tibbetts in 2018. Donald J. Trump had seized on her death to rail against illegal immigration.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/28/us/mollie-tibbetts-murder-guilty-sentence.html', 'snippet': 'Cristhian Bahena Rivera was found guilty of first-degree murder in the killing of Mollie Tibbetts in 2018. Donald J. Trump had seized on her death to rail against illegal immigration.', 'lead_paragraph': 'A farmworker was found guilty of first-degree murder on Friday in the fatal stabbing of a University of Iowa student who had vanished while jogging in 2018, a case that briefly inflamed the national debate over immigration.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [], 'headline': {'main': 'Farmworker Convicted of Fatally Stabbing Iowa College Student', 'kicker': None, 'content_kicker': None, 'print_headline': '', 'name': None, 'seo': None, 'sub': None}, 'keywords': [{'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Murders, Attempted Murders and Homicides', 'rank': 1, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'subject', 'value': 'Illegal Immigration', 'rank': 2, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'organizations', 'value': 'University of Iowa', 'rank': 3, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Rivera, Cristhian Bahena', 'rank': 4, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'persons', 'value': 'Tibbetts, Mollie', 'rank': 5, 'major': 'N'}, {'name': 'glocations', 'value': 'Brooklyn (Iowa)', 'rank': 6, 'major': 'N'}], 'pub_date': '2021-05-28T21:53:21+0000', 'document_type': 'article', 'news_desk': 'Express', 'section_name': 'U.S.', 'byline': {'original': 'By Michael Levenson', 'person': [{'firstname': 'Michael', 'middlename': None, 'lastname': 'Levenson', 'qualifier': None, 'title': None, 'role': 'reported', 'organization': '', 'rank': 1}], 'organization': None}, 'type_of_material': 'News', '_id': 'nyt://article/b253ec89-5fe9-5682-9fba-845b68d8629f', 'word_count': 723, 'uri': 'nyt://article/b253ec89-5fe9-5682-9fba-845b68d8629f'}, {'abstract': 'Adam Wagner knocks us out with a masterful Sunday debut.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/29/crosswords/daily-puzzle-2021-05-30.html', 'snippet': 'Adam Wagner knocks us out with a masterful Sunday debut.', 'lead_paragraph': 'SUNDAY PUZZLE — The visual element in this theme is such a delight! I’m not ashamed to say that I got butterflies in my stomach when I discovered it. Adam Wagner is a new constructor (two daily grids, both this April) and a new dad (as of only about two months, so Mr. Wagner’s having a fairly eventful Q2 of 2021, one could say). According to the puzzle’s print introduction, his new baby is already solving the daily crossword every night at home in San Francisco, presumably with a little help from Pop; that could make for an impressive lifelong solving streak.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/30/crosswords/30wordplay-chalk-art/30wordplay-chalk-art-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 407, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/30/crosswords/30wordplay-chalk-art/30wordplay-chalk-art-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 407}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/30/crosswords/30wordplay-chalk-art/30wordplay-chalk-art-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 695, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/30/crosswords/30wordplay-chalk-art/30wordplay-chalk-art-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1391, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/30/crosswords/30wordplay-chalk-art/30wordplay-chalk-art-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard