 traffic has roared back to nearly prepandemic levels; perhaps no one has a better front-row seat than traffic reporters.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Buzzing over New York City in a traffic helicopter on a morning in March of last year, Tom Kaminski, a radio traffic reporter for more than three decades, looked down at the rush hour commute. He gasped.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '5', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/nyregion/00nyvirus-traffic-1/merlin_188382972_b359dd02-b7a7-4de0-809f-3bedb273ca1b-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 399, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/27/nyregion/00nyvirus-traffic-1/merlin_188382972_b359dd02-b7a7-4de0-809f-3bedb273ca1b-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 399}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/nyregion/00nyvirus-traffic-1/merlin_188382972_b359dd02-b7a7-4de0-809f-3bedb273ca1b-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 681, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/nyregion/00nyvirus-traffic-1/merlin_188382972_b359dd02-b7a7-4de0-809f-3bedb273ca1b-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1363, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/nyregion/00nyvirus-traffic-1/00nyvirus-traffic-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/27/nyregion/00nyvirus-traffic-1/00nyvirus-traffic-1-thumbStandard.jpg', 'thumbnailwidth': 75, 'thumbnailheight': 75}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbLarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': No