g New Yorkers their first shot at “the best sunset picture of the year.” Sunday and two days in July will provide more opportunities.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/29/science/manhattanhenge-when-to-watch.html', 'snippet': 'Saturday will bring New Yorkers their first shot at “the best sunset picture of the year.” Sunday and two days in July will provide more opportunities.', 'lead_paragraph': 'For two days every spring and summer, the sunset lines up with Manhattan’s street grid, creating a gorgeous celestial spectacle. For a brief moment, the sun’s golden rays illuminate the city’s buildings and traffic with a breathtaking glow.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/29/science/29SCI-MANHATTANHENGE2/merlin_157875756_df94d145-0165-4756-9158-01d8ba7f7e2c-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 354, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/29/science/29SCI-MANHATTANHENGE2/merlin_157875756_df94d145-0165-4756-9158-01d8ba7f7e2c-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 354}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/29/science/29SCI-MANHATTANHENGE2/merlin_157875756_df94d145-0165-4756-9158-01d8ba7f7e2c-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 604, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/29/science/29SCI-MANHATTANHENGE2/merlin_157875756_df94d145-0165-4756-9158-01d8ba7f7e2c-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1207, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/29/science/29SCI-MANHATTANHENGE2/29SCI-MANHATTANHENGE2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subTyp