unt': 1859, 'uri': 'nyt://article/39b1b62d-0c52-5aa8-aa44-38c7047a7359'}, {'abstract': 'She spent decades arguing that the pope had helped the Jews during World War II, despite accusations that he had abdicated his moral responsibility.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/29/us/sister-margherita-marchione-dead.html', 'snippet': 'She spent decades arguing that the pope had helped the Jews during World War II, despite accusations that he had abdicated his moral responsibility.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Sister Margherita Marchione, who became known as “the fighting nun” for her defense of Pope Pius XII against allegations that he had failed to do as much as he could have to save the Jews from Nazi atrocities during World War II, died on May 19 at her convent, Villa Walsh, in Morristown, N.J. She was 99. ', 'print_section': 'B', 'print_page': '7', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/31/obituaries/31Marchione-obit1/merlin_188381535_8e183c58-8a79-4dbe-a83d-cd231cc65eb7-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 404, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/31/obituaries/31Marchione-obit1/merlin_188381535_8e183c58-8a79-4dbe-a83d-cd231cc65eb7-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 404}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/31/obituaries/31Marchione-obit1/merlin_188381535_8e183c58-8a79-4dbe-a83d-cd231cc65eb7-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 690, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/31/obituaries/31Marchione-obit1/merlin_188381535_8e183c58-8a79-4dbe-a83d-cd231cc65eb7-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1380, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'sub