he policies after the latest assault was captured on a widely watched video that showed a woman punching a flight attendant in the face.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/29/business/american-southwest-passengers-alcohol.html', 'snippet': 'American and Southwest announced the policies after the latest assault was captured on a widely watched video that showed a woman punching a flight attendant in the face.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Two major airlines, American and Southwest, have postponed plans to resume serving alcohol on flights in an effort to stop a surge of unruly and sometimes violent behavior by passengers who have shoved, struck and yelled at flight attendants.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/29/nyregion/29xp-soutwest-image/29xp-soutwest-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 312, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/29/nyregion/29xp-soutwest-image/29xp-soutwest-image-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 312}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/29/nyregion/29xp-soutwest-image/29xp-soutwest-image-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 532, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/29/nyregion/29xp-soutwest-image/29xp-soutwest-image-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1064, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/29/nyregion/29xp-soutwest-image/29xp-soutwest-image-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/29/nyregion/29xp-soutw