ayor of New York, Mr. Donovan is arguing that his leadership experience offers what the city needs in a time of crisis.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/31/nyregion/shaun-donovan-nyc-mayor.html', 'snippet': 'In running for mayor of New York, Mr. Donovan is arguing that his leadership experience offers what the city needs in a time of crisis.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Five years ago, a powerful New York-based political strategist was rooting around for someone whom voters could envision as the city’s next mayor, someone with the right type of experience and gravitas to take on the weakened incumbent, Bill de Blasio.', 'print_section': 'A', 'print_page': '1', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/30/nyregion/00nymayor-donovan-top/00nymayor-donovan-top-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 414, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/30/nyregion/00nymayor-donovan-top/00nymayor-donovan-top-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 414}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/30/nyregion/00nymayor-donovan-top/00nymayor-donovan-top-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 707, 'width': 1024, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/30/nyregion/00nymayor-donovan-top/00nymayor-donovan-top-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 1415, 'width': 2048, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/30/nyregion/00nymayor-donovan-top/00nymayor-donovan-top-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': {'thumbnail': 'images/2021/05/30/nyregion/00nym