 'uri': 'nyt://article/8dbd6bcd-d1f9-57d1-ad10-7159977841bc'}, {'abstract': 'What happens to the nearly two million people in our nation’s prison system demonstrates who we are as a people.', 'web_url': 'https://www.nytimes.com/2021/05/31/opinion/covid-new-york-state-prisons.html', 'snippet': 'What happens to the nearly two million people in our nation’s prison system demonstrates who we are as a people.', 'lead_paragraph': 'Witnessing unwarranted suffering is a solemn duty of the priesthood. But when one of my parishioners died of Covid-19 in a New York State prison, I felt the need to not only witness but to also tell the story he no longer can — the story of a prison system that failed to protect his life and the lives of so many others in its care, subjecting them to confusion, fear and even death.', 'source': 'The New York Times', 'multimedia': [{'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'xlarge', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/opinion/27paulikas-2/27paulikas-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'height': 802, 'width': 600, 'subType': 'xlarge', 'crop_name': 'articleLarge', 'legacy': {'xlarge': 'images/2021/05/27/opinion/27paulikas-2/27paulikas-2-articleLarge.jpg', 'xlargewidth': 600, 'xlargeheight': 802}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'jumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/opinion/27paulikas-2/27paulikas-2-jumbo.jpg', 'height': 1024, 'width': 767, 'subType': 'jumbo', 'crop_name': 'jumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'superJumbo', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/opinion/27paulikas-2/27paulikas-2-superJumbo.jpg', 'height': 2048, 'width': 1534, 'subType': 'superJumbo', 'crop_name': 'superJumbo', 'legacy': {}}, {'rank': 0, 'subtype': 'thumbnail', 'caption': None, 'credit': None, 'type': 'image', 'url': 'images/2021/05/27/opinion/27paulikas-2/27paulikas-2-thumbStandard.jpg', 'height': 75, 'width': 75, 'subType': 'thumbnail', 'crop_name': 'thumbStandard', 'legacy': 